# The eyes of an own head under the three lights of hair-light.bench (reports/content/2026-11-hero-head/eye-shader.md,
# "Приёмка"): a torch (Xardas' tower, the default save), the sun at noon in the Khorinis market (the face turned to it),
# the hearth and candle of the harbour house at 22:00. Under each: two stills of the eyes close up (from the front and
# three quarters), a walk of the camera round the face from one side to the other (the highlight on the cornea must
# slide, not flicker or drop out), and the eyes at work: a blink, a glance aside and a roll up, the camera still.
# Run it with the eye shader and with OPENGOTHIC_EYE_SHADER=0 on the same content for the pair "before | after":
#   TEMPEST_WINDOW_SIZE=1920x1080 BENCH_HOST=ryzen OPENGOTHIC_CONTENT=<content with the head> \
#     scripts/bench.sh scripts/bench/eye-light.bench <out>
# Needs a head whose face profile has "eyes" and the gestures glance and roll. The camera looks at the eyes
# (`cam look 11`: 11 cm over the head bone), not at the mouth.
# @timeout 900
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
cam lift off
blink off
# 1. A torch: Xardas' tower
set time 12 0
watch nearest
freeze nearest
wait 500
place 110 0
wait 800
watch player
cam face 30 0 1
cam look 11
wait 6000
shot torch-front
wait 300
cam face 30 35 1
cam look 11
wait 2500
shot torch-quarter
wait 300
cam face 34 -50 1
cam look 11
wait 2500
rec torch-round
cam face 34 -25 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 0 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 25 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 50 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
stop
cam face 30 15 1
cam look 11
wait 2000
rec torch-eyes
wait 500
faceanim player R_EYESBLINK 150
wait 900
facecue player glance R
wait 1300
facecue player roll R
wait 1300
stop
# 2. The sun: noon in the market square, the hero turned with the face to the sun
cam cut
set time 12 0
goto pos 7900 270 -4350
watch player
turn 180
cam face 30 0 1
cam look 11
wait 10000
shot sun-front
wait 300
cam face 30 35 1
cam look 11
wait 2500
shot sun-quarter
wait 300
cam face 34 -50 1
cam look 11
wait 2500
rec sun-round
cam face 34 -25 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 0 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 25 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 50 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
stop
cam face 30 15 1
cam look 11
wait 2000
rec sun-eyes
wait 500
faceanim player R_EYESBLINK 150
wait 900
facecue player glance R
wait 1300
facecue player roll R
wait 1300
stop
# 3. The hearth and the candle: the harbour house of perf-interior at 22:00
cam cut
set time 22 0
goto pos 3924 -73 -6663
watch player
cam face 30 0 1
cam look 11
wait 10000
shot candle-front
wait 300
cam face 30 35 1
cam look 11
wait 2500
shot candle-quarter
wait 300
cam face 34 -50 1
cam look 11
wait 2500
rec candle-round
cam face 34 -25 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 0 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 25 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
cam face 34 50 1
cam look 11
wait 1200
stop
cam face 30 15 1
cam look 11
wait 2000
rec candle-eyes
wait 500
faceanim player R_EYESBLINK 150
wait 900
facecue player glance R
wait 1300
facecue player roll R
wait 1300
stop
